28:T4e5,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"TaxiService","name":"Airport Taxi Service at Prince Mohammad Bin Abdulaziz Airport (MED)","description":"Pre-book a private transfer or private car with chauffeur from Prince Mohammad Bin Abdulaziz Airport (MED) — Madinah (Medina) — to your hotel near Masjid an-Nabawi (~20 km, ~25 min), or a long-distance transfer to Makkah. This is a pre-booked private airport transfer in your own vehicle: meet & greet at arrivals, flight tracking, spacious family vans, and 24/7 service for pilgrims and families.","url":"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/airports/prince-mohammad-madinah","provider":{"@id":"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/#taxiservice"},"serviceType":"Airport Transfer","areaServed":{"@type":"Airport","name":"Prince Mohammad Bin Abdulaziz Airport","iataCode":"MED","sameAs":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1552805"},"availableChannel":{"@type":"ServiceChannel","serviceUrl":"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/book","availableLanguage":["en","ar"]},"hoursAvailable":{"@type":"OpeningHoursSpecification","dayOfWeek":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"],"opens":"00:00","closes":"23:59"},"offers":{"@type":"Offer","priceCurrency":"SAR","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock"}}29:Tcc7,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much is a taxi from Madinah airport to the city?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A private transfer from Prince Mohammad Bin Abdulaziz Airport (MED) to central Madinah hotels is about 20 km and a 25-minute drive. It is a pre-booked private transfer in your own vehicle with meet & greet at arrivals. We do not publish a fixed price list; the fare is confirmed on WhatsApp before you book, with no meter and no surge."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you offer a private car service from Madinah Airport (MED)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Beyond a standard taxi, we offer a pre-booked private car service from Madinah Airport (MED) — an executive sedan, SUV or van through our partner network, with a professional driver and meet & greet at arrivals. Every booking is your own vehicle, quoted on WhatsApp before you travel."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a taxi at Madinah airport at night?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Transfers run 24/7 at MED, including late-night and early-morning arrivals. Share your flight number when you book; we track your flight, so the pickup moves with a delay, and the first 15–30 minutes of waiting after landing are free."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where do I meet my driver at Madinah airport?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Your driver meets you at arrivals and helps with your luggage to the vehicle. Driver details reach you on WhatsApp before you land; if anything about the meeting point changes we message you there."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I travel directly from Madinah airport to Makkah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We offer a direct MED to Makkah transfer — about 450 km, roughly 4 hours 20 minutes of driving — with prayer and rest stops on request. It suits pilgrims connecting between the Holy Cities, and Makkah to MED is available for the flight home."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you have vehicles for large families with luggage?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Vans such as the Hyundai Staria, plus SUVs, are available through our partner network for families with extra luggage arriving at MED. Tell us the number of passengers and large bags and we confirm the right vehicle when we quote."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can the driver take me to the door of my hotel near Masjid an-Nabawi?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The driver takes you to the nearest permitted drop-off point to your hotel. Vehicle access around Al-Masjid an-Nabawi and the Central Area (Markaziyah) is restricted and changes around prayer times, so please give us the exact hotel name and tell us about heavy bags or mobility needs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is a private transfer better than the airport bus or a regular taxi?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It depends on who is travelling. A private transfer suits families, elderly passengers, heavy luggage and late arrivals because it is one vehicle, hotel-bound, with your flight tracked. A solo traveller with light bags may prefer public transport or a regular taxi. We only offer pre-booked private transfers."}}]}1c:["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-[#FAFAF7] text-[#1C1C1C] pb-24","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$28"}}]],[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$29"}}]],"$L2a","$L2b","$L2c"]}]
